    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to offer for sale this fantastic 2 bedroom apartment with amazing water views located in Mariners Quay, Passage West. Offering an abundance of space and well laid out accommodation, this modern apartment offers the discerning purchaser comfortable open plan living accommodation, spacious rooms and parking space within the confines of this private gated development overlooking the water.\r\nThe apartment is maintained to a high standard and benefits from this most convenient location. \r\n\r\nThe apartment has been extensively renovated throughout, including a completely refurbished bathroom and new flooring with insulation underneath. The kitchen has been upgraded with new tiling, cabinet doors, worktop, sink, tap and appliances, including a fridge, washing machine and hob.\r\nThe property also features new furniture, heating upgrades and bespoke timber detailing to the TV wall and fridge cabinet. The balcony has been fully upgraded with a new floor and premium-quality timber frame.\r\n\r\nThe annual service charge is €2,538.36 per unit (approximately €48.81 per week). This charge includes refuse collection, lift servicing, cleaning and maintenance of the common areas, and block insurance. An early payment discount of €200 is available."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \r\nTimber Flooring\n\r\n\r\nKitchen / Living Room - 6.64m x 3.89m \r\nTiled / Timber Flooring\nFully Fitted Kitchen\nBalcony overlooking harbour\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.0m x 3.0m \r\nTimber Flooring \nEn-suite: 2 piece suite with electric shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 2.1m \r\nTimber Flooring\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.46m x 2.12m \r\nThree piece suite\nTiled Flooring\r\n\r\nStorage Room - 1.46m x 1.44m \r\nTimber Flooring\r\n\r\n"
      },
